## psc/os/shell.pengu — quoting seguro para `system()`.
##
## `rites.exec` une argv con espacios y usa `system()`. Este módulo construye
## una línea con quoting POSIX de cada argumento para que paths con espacios o
## metacaracteres no se interpreten.

import std.builder

insignia psc_os_shell_

## Cita un argumento para `/bin/sh`.
##
## ## Memoria
## Devuelve string owned.
weave quote with s as string into string:
    var sb as StringBuilder is calling StringBuilder.new
    defer banish sb
    calling sb.append_char with '\''
    var b as ref to frozen byte is bytes of s
    var i as int is 0
    while i < s length:
        var c as int is ((b at i) to int)
        if c == 39:
            calling sb.append with "'\\''"
        else:
            var one as string is s at i to (i + 1)
            calling sb.append with one
            banish one
        set i is i + 1
    calling sb.append_char with '\''
    return calling sb.finish

## Construye una línea de comando citando `cmd` y `args`.
##
## ## Memoria
## Devuelve string owned.
weave join with cmd as string, args as list of string into string:
    var sb as StringBuilder is calling StringBuilder.new
    defer banish sb
    var c as string is calling quote with cmd
    calling sb.append with c
    banish c
    for a in args:
        calling sb.append with " "
        var q as string is calling quote with a
        calling sb.append with q
        banish q
    return calling sb.finish
